><div class="navbar-buttons"><a href="https://app.sprig.com/login" target="_blank" class="navbar-link is-login w-nav-link">Sign in</a><a data-wf--button-arrow--design-variant="dark" href="/demo" class="button_v2 is-arrow w-inline-block"><div>Book a demo</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69af6a39b0f21be29de2cd48_arrow-right.svg" alt=""/></a></div><div class="navbar-mobile_button w-nav-button"><div class="nav_mobile-button"><img width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69c1df621cb91b00b1ba2713_hamburger%20nav%201.svg" loading="lazy" class="icon-1x1-xlarge is-open"/><img width="32" height="32" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69c1df5e5ec385db48d54f6d_close%20icon%201.svg" loading="lazy" class="icon-1x1-xlarge is-close"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><main class="main-wrapper"><section class="section_hero"><div class="padding-global"><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><aside class="container-medium"><div class="max-width-40 align-center position-relative"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10c3e73e539bc82db563ef_dovetail-icon_hero.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="integrations-hero_top-left"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10c3e73d584c533bd44dd7_zapier-icon_hero.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="integrations-hero_mid-left"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10c3e6315e453a55a218f1_chat-icon_hero.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="integrations-hero_bottom-left"/><div class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium text-align-center">Integrations</div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><h1 class="heading-style-h1_v2 text-align-center">Integrate Sprig across your research stack</h1><div class="spacer-medium"></div><p class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium text-align-center">Connect Sprig with your research tools to centralize user insights, streamline research operations, and maximize your impact.</p><div class="spacer-large"></div><div class="hero-buttons_v2"><a data-wf--button-fill--design-variant="dark" href="/demo" class="button_v2 w-button is-large">Book a demo</a></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10c3e7c0c53144bcd1e722_user-interview_hero.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="integrations-hero_bottom-right"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10c3e7315e453a55a2193b_Figma-icon_hero.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="integrations-hero_mid-right"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10c3e68dae8b81d39f1a9c_claude-icon_hero.svg" loading="eager" alt="" class="integrations-hero_top-right"/></div></aside><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div></div></section><section class="section_integrations-overview"><div class="padding-global"><aside class="container-large"><div class="divider_v2"></div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="side-text-img_container"><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Test with external panels &amp; tap into new audiences.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Recruit panel participants and manage incentives when you’re looking for feedback outside your own user base.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="integrations-list_container"><a href="/integrations/user-interviews" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/655651855c020a03b7e8f639_user%20interviews.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="user interviews" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">User Interviews</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loadi