20User%20Insights.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img_100"/></div><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Share user insights for seamless collaboration.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Share user insights instantly across teams by connecting Sprig to your team’s communication workflows.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="integrations-list_container"><a href="/integrations/slack" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65565078771ddfee64172682_slack.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="slack logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Slack</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a><a href="/integrations/zapier" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6556507993d130851f14be57_zapier.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="zapier" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Zapier</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a></div></div></div><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><div class="side-text-img_container"><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Test designs &amp; prototypes built in your favorite tools.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Leverage Sprig’s 1-click integrations with 12 top design tools and easily embed them into your prototype tests.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div cl