rapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bacdde52cfd0c419f0de_Frame%202087329490.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bacdde52cfd0c419f0de_Frame%202087329490-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bacdde52cfd0c419f0de_Frame%202087329490-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bacdde52cfd0c419f0de_Frame%202087329490.avif 1446w" alt="" class="img_100"/></div><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Embed Sprig into your product in just a few hours.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Using Segment or Google Tag Manager? Easily import your user events and attributes to trigger your Sprig In-Product Surveys.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="integrations-list_container"><a href="/integrations/segment-web" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65564d7110c1832d9f35cd90_segment.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="segment logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Segment</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a><a href="/integrations/google-tag-manager" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65564d71463db4540f14891d_google%20tag%20manager.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="gtm logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Google Tag Manger</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a></div></div></div><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><div class="side-text-img_container"><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Leverage user data for enhanced targeting.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Get targeted insights from specific users with the user event &amp; attribute data your product already tracks.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="integrations-list_container"><a href="/integrations/census" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65564eb7af7bb36d7c3f8fa4_census.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="census logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Census</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a><a href="/integrations/segment-web" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65564d7110c1832d9f35cd90_segment.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="segment logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Segment</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a><a href="/integrations/rudderstack" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65a7089dea431f26e653debe_rudderstack.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="rudderstack logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">RudderStack</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a></div></div><div class="side-text-img_img-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a0f3a3d1b7dda25511ea562_Enhanced%20Targeting.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img_100"/></div></div><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><div class="side-text-img_container reverse"><div class="side-text-img_img-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bb44b09619d4debebda8_Share%20User%20Insights.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bb44b09619d4debebda8_Share%20User%20Insights-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bb44b09619d4debebda8_Share%20User%20Insights-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a10bb44b09619d4debebda8_Share%20User%20Insights.avif 1446w" alt="" class="img_100"/></div><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Combine quant &amp; qual data for deeper insights.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Integrate Sprig with your analytics platforms to uncover the &#x27;why&#x27; behind the &#x27;what&#x27; in user actions.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="integrations-list_container"><a href="/integrations/mixpanel" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65564f87053d5641403853ed_mixpanel.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="mixpanel logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Mixpanel</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a><a href="/integrations/amplitude" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/65564f8613b018e9e64a68c4_amplitude.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="amplitude logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Amplitude</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a></div></div></div><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><div class="side-text-img_container"><div class="side-text-img_text-wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2 display-inline">Understand the “why” behind A/B test results.</h2><div class="heading-style-h3_v2 text-color-neutral display-inline"> Capture user sentiment data alongside metrics in your A/B tests to reveal why a specific variant won.</div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="integrations-list_container"><a href="/integrations/optimizely" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6556501a507f6a9d81725fb8_optimizely.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="optimizely logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">Optimizely</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a><a href="/integrations/launchdarkly" class="integrations-list_link w-inline-block"><div class="integrations-list-inner_link"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6556501a0b094bbeae1f3c16_launchdarkly.svg" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" alt="launchdarkly logo" class="integrations_link-img"/><p class="text-size-small_v2">LaunchDarkly</p></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/69ffa6624a9e5aa15f36cdac_arrow-right_faint.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="integrations-list_link_arrow"/></a></div></div><div class="side-text-img_img-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/651206cc884d0caef0f4c520/6a0f3a4e8cffb1788f157e18_AB%20Testing.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="img_100"/></div></div><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div></aside></div></section><section class="section_integrations"><div class="padding-global"><aside class="container-large"><div class="divider_v2"></div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div class="side-split-heading_wrapper"><div class="side-split-heading_headings-container is-25"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2">All Integrations</h2></div><div class="side-split-heading_main-container is-75"><div class="max-width-75"><h2 class="heading-style-h3_v2">Connect Sprig with your (other) favorite apps <span class="text-color-neutral">to easily share user insights across your team‘s favorite tools.</span></h2></div></div></div><div class="spacer-xxhuge"></div><div class="side-split-heading_wrapper"><div class="side-split-heading_headings-container is-25"><h3 class="heading-style-h4_v2">Panels</h3></div><div class="side-split-heading_main-container is-75"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="integrations_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/user-interviews" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/65314f1baacd0a6685ef6235_user%20interviews.svg" class="integration-card_logo"/><div class="spacer-large"></div><h4 class="heading-style-h4_v2">User Interviews</h4><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="w-embed"><p class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium">Send Sprig studies to User Interviews to test with the right users at the right moment</p></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-xhuge"></div><div class="side-split-heading_wrapper"><div class="side-split-heading_headings-container is-25"><h3 class="heading-style-h4_v2">LLMs</h3></div><div class="side-split-heading_main-container is-75"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="integrations_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/claude" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/6a2c2c73efa0b10cfcaf2a48_claude-icon.svg" class="integration-card_logo"/><div class="spacer-large"></div><h4 class="heading-style-h4_v2">Claude</h4><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="w-embed"><p class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium">Connect Sprig with Claude to power multi-system workflows</p></div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/chatgpt" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/6a2c2f636b54ea0d8ff055af_Frame%202087329502%20(1).svg" class="integration-card_logo"/><div class="spacer-large"></div><h4 class="heading-style-h4_v2">ChatGPT</h4><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="w-embed"><p class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium">Connect Sprig with ChatGPT to power multi-system workflows.</p></div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/gemini" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/6a2c3053dae8837408aebbef_Frame%202087329501.png" sizes="100px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c