g via the Public API to send user data from any source</p></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-xhuge"></div><div class="side-split-heading_wrapper"><div class="side-split-heading_headings-container is-25"><h3 class="heading-style-h4_v2">Analytics</h3></div><div class="side-split-heading_main-container is-75"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="integrations_collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/data-export-api" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/6515cc3d8b89ba6e33449d44_data%20export%20api-1.svg" class="integration-card_logo"/><div class="spacer-large"></div><h4 class="heading-style-h4_v2">Data Export API</h4><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="w-embed"><p class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium">Export Sprig data via the Data Export API to analyze and transform study results</p></div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/webhooks" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/6515ccdcac091f50c74d8954_webhooks.svg" class="integration-card_logo"/><div class="spacer-large"></div><h4 class="heading-style-h4_v2">Webhooks</h4><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="w-embed"><p class="text-size-small_v2 text-color-medium">Send Sprig data via Webhooks to trigger workflows in any tool you use</p></div></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/integrations/mixpanel" class="cms-link-block w-inline-block"><div class="integration-card"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6515c0b8d248616d9d2aedf6/655640004dd19e816a2e33d6_mixpanel.svg" class="integration-card_logo"/><div